(  195) !      03-08-29 : Clean-up, deep/shallow switches  P.Bechtold
(  196) !      04-02-11 : Add tracer transport             P.Bechtold
(  197) !      05-02-11 : Positive scaling of total Mflux  P.Bechtold
(  198) !      M.Hamrud      01-Oct-2003 CY28 Cleaning
(  199) !      04-12-03 : Turn off shallow convection over stratocu. M.Ko"hler
(  200) !      05-06-27 : Switch off ddraught if idtop<kctop  
