(  206) !                 scale, contain momentum computations in cumastrn
(  207) !      07-10-09 : Added KE dissipation and convective scavenging   P. Bechtold
(  208) !      12-03-02 : remove all entrainment stuff     P. Bechtold
(  209) !      04-10-12 : Add RPLRG/RPLDARE for small planet  N.Semane+P.Bechtold  
